        {
          "id": 2341690329,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I intended the dash, to imply that I've been maintaining from 2020 onwards (didn't really want to give an end date).  Also not entirely comfortable with asserting Copyright there, as others have also contributed.  I do work for Keysight, but didn't want to name it twice.\n\nI just wanted anyone interested in the dissector to be able to find me without digging through git history :)  Without giving my email address.",
